  "notes": [
    "The 16 January 2018 OS3/m68k command, shared library and MUI preferences editor match the Aminet release. The English guide also matches.",
    "The checked BCWB payload supplies the preferences icon and saved ENVARC profile. The common startup sequence exposes the profile through ENV. The saved profile disables all six browser entries.",
    "The installed Processfile.rexx and SimpleFind guide invoke the command. WHDLoad and Voodoo-X use the library. Those consumers and the shared MUI tree retain their existing ownership."
